                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a8a4c288-5a09-324e-a53d-37b91f218904",
                        "entry_id": "5b39795b-3226-39d3-8ae4-e42aeaf2f999",
                        "glosses": [
                            "свойство по значению прилагательного индивидуальный; отдельность"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "77f4e947-111e-3c85-aee2-c52a4a0ef4f4",
                        "entry_id": "5b39795b-3226-39d3-8ae4-e42aeaf2f999",
                        "glosses": [
                            "совокупность характерных, своеобразных черт, отличающих какого-либо человека от другого"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d934348-61f0-40eb-b462-1db9a780f095",
                                "sense_id": "77f4e947-111e-3c85-aee2-c52a4a0ef4f4",
                                "text": "— Разве это жизнь? Нет никакого простора индивидуальности. Всё одно и то же, пятилетка в четыре года, пятилетка в три года."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "40a9cfe2-34d3-327f-bbc9-dd89def99664",
                        "entry_id": "5b39795b-3226-39d3-8ae4-e42aeaf2f999",
                        "glosses": [
                            "человек как носитель личных, характерных для него признаков, свойств"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e611b423-637a-4f99-afc7-c0467043eb18",
                        "source_entry_id": "5b39795b-3226-39d3-8ae4-e42aeaf2f999",
                        "target_lang_word": "individuality",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "individuality",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9d10d1b-5286-3e11-ac28-6a233d4f8e5f",
                                        "entry_id": "2f82e7a4-2a81-393b-b955-2ed272620c12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The characteristics that contribute to the differentiation or distinction of someone or something from a group of otherwise comparable identity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39a0febf-d284-4257-85a3-7a217e9ac7fc",
                                                "sense_id": "d9d10d1b-5286-3e11-ac28-6a233d4f8e5f",
                                                "text": "It is affirmed, that individuality pervades universal nature; that it is positively the most fundamental and universal principle which the finite mind seems capable of discovering, and the best image of the infinite. There are no two objects in the universe which are precisely alike."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "370bccee-c154-4708-ab04-ecaf0513b9ae",
                                                "sense_id": "d9d10d1b-5286-3e11-ac28-6a233d4f8e5f",
                                                "text": "Even in an era when individuality in dress is a cult, his clothes were noticeable. He was wearing a hard hat of the low round kind favoured by hunting men, and with it a black duffle-coat lined with white."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a9fae9d-d8f6-47d1-9a99-3a31f7281746",
                                                "sense_id": "d9d10d1b-5286-3e11-ac28-6a233d4f8e5f",
                                                "text": "The researchers posit that something they call the “hipster effect” asserts itself in human populations no matter how individualistic we imagine ourselves to be, because it’s individuality itself that sparks conformity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce9003b4-df9c-3d5f-8c48-04a57d1796b2",
                                        "entry_id": "2f82e7a4-2a81-393b-b955-2ed272620c12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7cec0e5-bd73-4f06-be4b-02b93464750b",
                                                "sense_id": "ce9003b4-df9c-3d5f-8c48-04a57d1796b2",
                                                "text": "As persons, therefore—gigantic individualities—they wheeled into the feudal ranks and assumed feudal powers and responsibilities."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "080c0c6b-1810-4491-a524-a223f2486e15",
                        "source_entry_id": "5b39795b-3226-39d3-8ae4-e42aeaf2f999",
                        "target_lang_word": "personality",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "personality",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7af62e48-f690-309a-b415-d6ab095f6971",
                                        "entry_id": "e535b6c9-b703-3d24-826e-b085c1f98167",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A set of non-physical psychological and social qualities that make one person distinct from another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65b6c77c-d6ba-4afd-9cad-ccb2087a741f",
                                                "sense_id": "7af62e48-f690-309a-b415-d6ab095f6971",
                                                "text": "The president has a unique personality."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46636b93-0383-4a22-bfc4-fb4121461d22",
                                                "sense_id": "7af62e48-f690-309a-b415-d6ab095f6971",
                                                "text": "Personality is individuality existing in itself, but with a nature as a ground."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96b86bf4-eaa7-4d4b-b068-c91f0b97a311",
                                                "sense_id": "7af62e48-f690-309a-b415-d6ab095f6971",
                                                "text": "Meanwhile Nanny Broome was recovering from her initial panic and seemed anxious to make up for any kudos she might have lost, by exerting her personality to the utmost. She took the policeman's helmet and placed it on a chair, and unfolded his tunic to shake it and fold it up again for him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "19991805-3806-3954-a1a0-a7d84c89a04e",
                                        "entry_id": "e535b6c9-b703-3d24-826e-b085c1f98167",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Charisma, or qualities that make a person stand out from the crowd."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "197124d6-e3b2-413e-8144-7334df38973b",
                                                "sense_id": "19991805-3806-3954-a1a0-a7d84c89a04e",
                                                "text": "The best contestant shows most personality."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bb6071a-ab64-4fc6-aa4f-82f693d50282",
                                                "sense_id": "19991805-3806-3954-a1a0-a7d84c89a04e",
                                                "text": "But over and over / I´ll be a fool for you / 'cause you got personality."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44c9a50c-7bff-3439-92c7-a9d72e291cd3",
                                        "entry_id": "e535b6c9-b703-3d24-826e-b085c1f98167",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A set of qualities that make something distinctive or interesting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38fbada2-fe8c-4349-980a-31a547aea2da",
                                                "sense_id": "44c9a50c-7bff-3439-92c7-a9d72e291cd3",
                                                "text": "His writing has a lot of personality."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7db983c-3dca-4a10-b907-ff131578346f",
                                                "sense_id": "44c9a50c-7bff-3439-92c7-a9d72e291cd3",
                                                "text": "This functional concrete building lacks personality."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21dc13dd-afe8-4598-8cba-9f20870f2e24",
                                                "sense_id": "44c9a50c-7bff-3439-92c7-a9d72e291cd3",
                                                "text": "Dubbels typically have a rich, complex, malt-centered personality and a copper or caramel color."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3efa6048-8d3c-3b40-b265-0d0184258481",
                                        "entry_id": "e535b6c9-b703-3d24-826e-b085c1f98167",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An assumed role or manner of behavior."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf2cc98e-2bb8-452b-b33c-b30de1fe3f71",
                                                "sense_id": "3efa6048-8d3c-3b40-b265-0d0184258481",
                                                "text": "In his final act, the comedian takes on a child's personality."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "67d6553c-1984-354a-8f82-4c78955870ab",
                                        "entry_id": "e535b6c9-b703-3d24-826e-b085c1f98167",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A celebrity, especially one with a strong media presence (e.g. an actor, singer, or sports player)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "befb5110-8cf4-4ace-8151-922c3752b884",
                                                "sense_id": "67d6553c-1984-354a-8f82-4c78955870ab",
                                                "text": "Johnny Carson was a respected television personality."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1dcb92fb-1c8a-31b7-99b0-b7e222ee0008",
                                        "entry_id": "e535b6c9-b703-3d24-826e-b085c1f98167",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something said or written which refers to the person, conduct, etc., of some individual, especially something of a disparaging or offensive nature; personal remarks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e0b129e-137e-48ec-b9dc-d47ff2928996",
                                                "sense_id": "1dcb92fb-1c8a-31b7-99b0-b7e222ee0008",
                                                "text": "indulgence in personalities"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89b97ad4-33d7-4b3f-ac4c-eefc07d3f5dd",
                                                "sense_id": "1dcb92fb-1c8a-31b7-99b0-b7e222ee0008",
                                                "text": "Sharp personalities were exchanged."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "926f4c4e-9d27-4822-ac99-2f7dec2cde39",
                                                "sense_id": "1dcb92fb-1c8a-31b7-99b0-b7e222ee0008",
                                                "text": "Perceiving that personalities were not out of order, I asked him what species of beast had long ago twisted and mutilated his left ear."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "830ff6f3-a4bc-381c-b058-7737b5ff24a8",
                                        "entry_id": "e535b6c9-b703-3d24-826e-b085c1f98167",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That quality of a law which concerns the condition, state, and capacity of persons."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd39ab16-f761-32b0-ad0f-4e0db293c87e",
